Identical conditions cannot be used by multiple prompts.
Duplicate item: {ITEM} prompt
Condition: {CONDITION}

The following knowledge entries will be deleted:

{PREVIEW}

Total: {COUNT}. This action cannot be undone.

Enter an age range in minimum-maximum format.
Example: 18-35
Current value: {MIN}-{MAX}

Keywords: {KEYWORDS}
RAG short texts: {RAG}
Prompts: {VARIANTS}
Text mappings: {MAPPINGS}

Enter keywords to search mapping types.
Examples: clan kingdom / settlement ruler / spouse / age / status alive / kingdom eliminated{QUERY}
Matches: {COUNT}{EMPTY}

Welcome to AnimusForge! Use this screen to add extra names for your character. If you do not need them, continue to appearance and background settings.

Character name: {NAME}{CONFLICT}
Extra names: {OPTIONAL}

Player information is divided into appearance and background information.

Appearance (always visible):
{APPEARANCE}

Background (general):
{BACKGROUND}

Conditional background details: {COUNT}

Configuration source: {SOURCE}
Current mode: {MODE}
Semantic retrieval: {ENABLED}
Semantic first: {FIRST}
Knowledge return limit: {TOPK}
Details: each mentioned term is retrieved independently in importance order, with one knowledge slot per term. If the highest-scoring knowledge is already used by an earlier term, the next unused knowledge is selected. Additional terms are only filled when the limit is greater than the number of terms.

{ROLE}: select the whole category or individual NPCs.
Whole category: {SELECTED}
Specific entries selected: {SPECIFIC}
Total results: {TOTAL}, page {PAGE}/{PAGES}

