Roles: {ROLES}
Specific identities: {IDENTITIES}
SkillMin: {SKILLS}
Gender: {GENDER}
ClanLeader: {CLAN_LEADER}

Source text: {SOURCE}
Mapping type: {KIND}
Target {TARGET_TYPE}: {TARGET}{STATUS}{EMPTY}{AGE}
Current preview: {PREVIEW}
